  MeshShadowMode: None
  ShadowColor: {x: 1.000000, y: 1.000000, z: 1.000000, w: 1.000000}
  ShadowDensity: 1.000000
  Text: |-
    AiPreviewAgentInteract lets a coding agent drive the SIK hands in the Lens Studio Preview: pinch, poke, hover, drag and rotate.
    The two cubes are targets for it. Each label counts the triggers, hovers and drags that reach it, so you can watch the agent act. On device the package does nothing.
